      "text": "1. Setup project laravel 13\n2. Mengenal struktur folder\n    - routes\n    - resource/views\n    - app/Http/Controller\n    - app/Http/Models\n    - database/migrations\n    - database/seeders\n    - .env\n3. Penjelasan tentang routing\n    - web.php\n        -coba usecase success\n        -coba usecase notfound\n        -print text\n        -print dari file\n        -print dari folder/file\n4. Penjelasan tentang Controller\n    - https://laravel.com/framework/docs/controllers\n        - create controller via artisan\n              - php artisan make:controller BookController --resource\n        - create funct index di controller\n        - panggil controller dari route\n        - panggil views dari controller\n        - tambahkan variabel di controller kirim ke views\n        - panggil variabel di views {{ $var }}\n        - gunakan fungsi compaq pada controller supaya lebih ringkas\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Setup project laravel 13\n2. Mengenal struktur folder\n    - routes\n    - resource/views\n    - app/Http/Controller\n    - app/Http/Models\n    - database/migrations\n    - database/seeders\n    - .env\n3. Penjelasan tentang routing\n    - web.php\n        -coba usecase success\n        -coba usecase notfound\n        -print text\n        -print dari file\n        -print dari folder/file\n4. Penjelasan tentang Controller\n    - https://laravel.com/framework/docs/controllers\n        - create controller via artisan\n              - php artisan make:controller BookController --resource\n        - create funct index di controller\n        - panggil controller dari route\n        - panggil views dari controller\n        - tambahkan variabel di controller kirim ke views\n        - panggil variabel di views {{ $var }}\n        - gunakan fungsi compaq pada controller supaya lebih ringkas\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
